  "subject": "a couple restoring a temple roof in Tainan in cut-porcelain (jian nian), she on the scaffold snipping red and green bowls into thin strips with her nippers and handing them down, he pressing each one into wet cement to build a dragon's whiskers, passing pieces back and forth all afternoon while the master shouts at them from below",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien Afrobeats love song in the mid-tempo Afro-pop style. A syncopated Afrobeats drum groove with shakers, rim clicks and talking-drum fills; a warm, round bass guitar; two interlocking highlife-style clean electric guitars picking bright patterns; soft Rhodes chords underneath. Warm, airy mix with gentle stereo percussion. A smooth male tenor lead, relaxed and sweet, with a soft female harmony doubling him on the chorus. 104 BPM, B-flat major. Tender, playful and sure of her. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drop, no amapiano log drum, no reggae skank.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n台南的廟頂 下晡日頭赤炎炎\n你坐佇鷹架頂 手提鉗仔\n紅碗 青碗 剪做細細條\n一塊一塊 伸手交予我\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我共伊 黏入去紅毛塗\n龍的喙鬚 一寸一寸生出來\n\n[Chorus]\n你剪 我黏 規个下晡\n你交一塊 我接一塊\n指頭仔 相碰一下\n龍鬚 就閣加一寸\n\n[Verse]\n你偷偷仔 剪一塊 粉紅的心\n叫我黏佇 龍鬚的尾溜\n下跤的人 攑頭 看袂著\n干焦你 佮我知\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n師傅 佇下跤 咧喝\n恁兩个 手較緊咧\n\n[Chorus]\n你剪 我黏 規个下晡\n你交一塊 我接一塊\n你佇頂面 偷偷仔笑\n龍鬚 就閣加一寸\n\n[Bridge]\n日頭 落佇 安平彼爿\n龍鬚 予日頭照甲 金爍爍\n你講 明仔載 欲剪龍目\n\n[Chorus]\n你剪 我黏 明仔載閣來\n你交一塊 我接一塊\n龍目 欲用 你揀的青碗\n你佇頂面 我佇下跤\n\n[Outro]\n明仔載 你剪 我黏",
